Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.10,0:00:04.73,English,en-0,0,0,0,,{\q2}Plan B first splits the army, rests at two verified locations, then regroups.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.10,0:00:03.02,Chinese,zh-0,0,0,0,,{\q2}方案B先分兵，到两处验证
Dialogue: 2,0:00:03.02,0:00:05.70,Chinese,zh-1,0,0,0,,{\q2}过的驻点休整，再会合。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:04.73,0:00:09.12,English,en-1,0,0,0,,{\q2}Each army's rest period starts on the day it actually becomes stationary.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:05.70,0:00:10.86,Chinese,zh-2,0,0,0,,{\q2}每队从真正停驻那天开始计时；达到预定库存和缺员
Dialogue: 1,0:00:09.12,0:00:13.00,English,en-2,0,0,0,,{\q2}Once the preset stock and troop-shortfall conditions are met, or
Dialogue: 2,0:00:10.86,0:00:15.80,Chinese,zh-3,0,0,0,,{\q2}条件，或者用完预定驻留时间，就按原计划离开。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.00,0:00:17.00,English,en-3,0,0,0,,{\q2}the preset stay expires, it leaves according to the original plan.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:15.80,0:00:19.37,Chinese,zh-4,0,0,0,,{\q2}恢复得不够，也是这次方案的结果，
Dialogue: 1,0:00:17.00,0:00:19.83,English,en-4,0,0,0,,{\q2}Insufficient recovery is also a result of this
Dialogue: 2,0:00:19.37,0:00:22.71,Chinese,zh-5,0,0,0,,{\q2}不能为了挑到好数字而重新开始。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.83,0:00:22.28,English,en-5,0,0,0,,{\q2}plan; we cannot restart to obtain better
Dialogue: 1,0:00:22.28,0:00:22.78,English,en-6,0,0,0,,{\q2}numbers.
